.TH DISGRACE 1 "October 2026" "disgrace 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
disgrace \- minimalist tracker-style digital audio workstation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B disgrace
.RI [ wxWidgets\ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B disgrace
is a minimalist tracker-style digital audio workstation focused on fast
keyboard-driven composition, clear structure, and real-time-safe audio
design. It uses JACK for audio and MIDI I/O and wxWidgets for the desktop
user interface.
.PP
The program takes no application-specific command-line arguments; only
the standard wxWidgets/GTK options are accepted.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/disgrace/imgs/disgrace.png
Application icon installed with the package.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR jackd (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Miroslav Shaltev <miroslav.shaltev@shaltev.de>
